# Bit34 Package Manager
#   Packages/   — where the tool clones the resolved dependencies
#   PackageDev/ — a working clone of this library's own source repo, which
#                 Unity compiles directly so the library can be developed
#                 in place. Both are materialized per machine; the tool's
#                 two config files are project state and stay in the repo.
Assets/Bit34/Packages/
Assets/Bit34/Packages.meta
Assets/Bit34/PackageDev/
Assets/Bit34/PackageDev.meta

